  <para>
    After applying the patterns, tuning the system and configuring &selnx;, the base operating
    system requirements are complete. &suse; recommends using supported &ansible; roles to automate
    the deployment process.
  </para>
  <para>
    To proceed with installing the &sap; workloads, see
